# Cargo's build trees are excluded so a local tree of build artifacts --
# gigabytes of it -- never enters the build context. Plan 16 L1 moved the crate
# to `rust/`, so both the old root-level `target` and the crate's `rust/target`
# are named. Issue #1051 needs one file back out of them:
# `BINARY_SOURCE=prebuilt` copies the release binary the pipeline already built
# instead of compiling it a second time inside BuildKit. The exception is the
# single file, not the directory, so nothing else follows it in.
target
rust/target
!rust/target/release/formal-ai
.git
ci-logs
docs/screenshots
